 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/10/09 14:48| 01 | 320| 006| 0549| 0166| 0420| 0856|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/10/09 14:36| 04 | 291| 080| 0283| 0048| 0218| 0395|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/10/09 12:36| 01 | 274| 006| 0193| 0018| 0178| 0219|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/10/09 07:36| 01 | 238| 010| 0209| 0032| 0166| 0249|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/10/09 06:24| 04 | 244| 014| 0230| 0165| 0106| 0625|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/10/08 20:48| 02 | 332| 010| 026"
